{t:'"I will give my infant fruits first."',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Solid foods are usually introduced at about 6 months of age, starting with rice cereal, which is the least allergenic.</i> The keyed answer is <b>"I will give my infant rice cereal first."</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
teach:'<b>An Overview of Growth, Development, and Nutrition</b> &middot; Leifer 10e test bank, Ch 15 item. Cognitive level: Cognitive. Bank tags: Nursing Process Step: Evaluation'},

{ch:'Ch 15',topic:'Growth, development, nutrition',bank:true,type:'MC',vuln:'low',
