{t:'Wrap the tooth in a clean tissue.',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>The tooth should be washed off and put in a container of milk to preserve it for possible reimplantation.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Wash off the tooth and place it in a container of milk.</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'},
{t:'Wash off the tooth and place it in a container of milk.',c:true,r:'Correct. The tooth should be washed off and put in a container of milk to preserve it for possible reimplantation.'}],
