{t:'The child believes that following the rules is right.',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>According to Kohlberg, children in the preconventional stage (4 to 7 years) are obedient to their parents for fear of punishment.</i> The keyed answer is <b>The child does not want to be punished.</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
