{ch:'Ch 15',topic:'Growth, development, nutrition',bank:true,type:'MC',vuln:'low',
stem:'What does the nurse calculate the basal metabolic index (BMI) of an 8-year-old child who is 48 inches tall (1.2 meters) and weighs 100 pounds (45.4 kg) to be?',
