{t:'37.6',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>The formula for BMI calculation is weight in kg divided by height in meters (squared): 45.4 (weight in kg) divided by 1.4 (1.2 squared) = 32.4. A BMI of over 30 is classified as obese.</i> The keyed answer is <b>32.4</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
teach:'<b>An Overview of Growth, Development, and Nutrition</b> &middot; Leifer 10e test bank, Ch 15 item. Cognitive level: Cognitive. Bank tags: Nursing Process Step: Implementation'},

