stem:'Which statement best corresponds to a preschooler\'s understanding of hospitalization?',
opts:[
{t:'"A germ made me get sick."',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>The preschooler may feel guilty, particularly if an accident happens as a result of mischief on his or her part.</i> The keyed answer is <b>"I got sick because I was mad at my brother."</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'},
{t:'"I got sick because I was mad at my brother."',c:true,r:'Correct. The preschooler may feel guilty, particularly if an accident happens as a result of mischief on his or her part.'},
{t:'"My tonsils are sick and they have to come out."',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>The preschooler may feel guilty, particularly if an accident happens as a result of mischief on his or her part.</i> The keyed answer is <b>"I got sick because I was mad at my brother."</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'},
{t:'"I have a cast because I broke my leg."',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>The preschooler may feel guilty, particularly if an accident happens as a result of mischief on his or her part.</i> The keyed answer is <b>"I got sick because I was mad at my brother."</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
