{t:'Denial',c:true,r:'Correct. In the stage of denial or detachment, the child appears to deny the need for the parents and becomes uninterested in their visits.'},
{t:'Attachment',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>In the stage of denial or detachment, the child appears to deny the need for the parents and becomes uninterested in their visits.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Denial</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
