{t:'"Your mommy is coming in 4 hours."',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>The toddler and preschooler do not understand time yet. They understand time relationships through activities in their experience, such as naptime and mealtimes.</i> The keyed answer is <b>"Your mommy will be here when you have lunch."</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
teach:'<b>The Child\'s Experience of Hospitalization</b> &middot; Leifer 10e test bank, Ch 21 item. Cognitive level: Cognitive. Bank tags: Nursing Process Step: Implementation'},

