{t:'Ask the child to draw a picture about her feelings.',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Distractions such as blowing bubbles, looking through a kaleidoscope, and playing with pop-up toys may help reduce anxiety and pain.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Play with the child using pop-up toys.</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
