{ch:'Ch 21',topic:'Hospitalized child',bank:true,type:'MC',vuln:'low',
stem:'What statement by the parent of a hospitalized toddler leads the nurse to determine the parent understands a hospitalized toddler\'s need for transitional objects?',
opts:[
