{t:'"He insisted on bringing this dirty old blanket with him."',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>The use of a transitional object such as a blanket or a favorite toy promotes security.</i> The keyed answer is <b>"This stuffed animal makes him feel secure."</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'},
