{t:'"I\'d like to get him some toys from the playroom."',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>The use of a transitional object such as a blanket or a favorite toy promotes security.</i> The keyed answer is <b>"This stuffed animal makes him feel secure."</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
teach:'<b>The Child\'s Experience of Hospitalization</b> &middot; Leifer 10e test bank, Ch 21 item. Cognitive level: Cognitive. Bank tags: Nursing Process Step: Evaluation'},

