{t:'Fear of bodily harm',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Forced dependency in the hospital, such as immobilization, can result in a feeling of loss of control and loss of security.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Loss of control</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
