{t:'Decreased emotional impact of illness',c:true,r:'Correct. All options listed are advantages of outpatient services with the exception of recuperating at the facility.'}],
teach:'<b>The Child\'s Experience of Hospitalization</b> &middot; Leifer 10e test bank, Ch 21 item. Cognitive level: Cognitive. Bank tags: Nursing Process Step: Implementation'},

