{t:'Pain',c:true,r:'Correct. Small children all share the same basic fears relative to hospitalization, which are separation from family, pain, and body intrusion or mutilation.'},
{t:'Cost',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Small children all share the same basic fears relative to hospitalization, which are separation from family, pain, and body intrusion or mutilation.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Separation / Pain / Body intrusion</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'},
{t:'Body intrusion',c:true,r:'Correct. Small children all share the same basic fears relative to hospitalization, which are separation from family, pain, and body intrusion or mutilation.'}],
