{t:'Falls frequently and is clumsy.',c:true,r:'Correct. Frequent falling and clumsiness are clinical manifestations of Duchenne\'s muscular dystrophy.'},
{t:'Has delayed fine-motor development.',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Frequent falling and clumsiness are clinical manifestations of Duchenne\'s muscular dystrophy.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Falls frequently and is clumsy.</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
