{t:'Sleeping with two pillows under the head',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Application of moist heat, with a compress or by tub bath upon awakening in the morning, will help to lessen stiffness.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Applying moist heat packs upon awakening</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
