{t:'Ropes are on pulleys.',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Buck traction is dependent on the child as a counterweight. The heels should be elevated above the level of the foot of the bed.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Child\'s heels are placed firmly against the foot of the bed.</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
