{t:'Take the child to the bathroom and turn on a hot shower.',c:true,r:'Correct. The child experiencing laryngeal spasm should be placed in a high-humidity environment, such as the bathroom with a hot shower running. The humidity liquefies secretions and reduces spasm.'},
{t:'Have the child drink plenty of fluids.',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>The child experiencing laryngeal spasm should be placed in a high-humidity environment, such as the bathroom with a hot shower running. The humidity liquefies secretions and reduces spasm.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Take the child to the bathroom and turn on a hot shower.</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
