{t:'Sore throat from postnasal drip',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Hemorrhage is the most common postoperative complication. Blood trickling down the back of the child\'s throat could cause frequent swallowing.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Bleeding from the surgical site</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'},
{t:'Potential vomiting',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Hemorrhage is the most common postoperative complication. Blood trickling down the back of the child\'s throat could cause frequent swallowing.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Bleeding from the surgical site</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
