{t:'Cola drink',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Small amounts of clear liquids can be offered to the child. Synthetic fruit juices are not as irritating as natural juices. A popsicle is usually well-tolerated.</i> The keyed answer is <b>A popsicle</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
