{t:'Expiratory wheezing',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Restlessness is a primary sign of increased respiratory obstruction.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Restlessness</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
