{t:'Heart muscle and the mitral valve',c:true,r:'Correct. The tissues that cover the heart and heart valves are affected. The heart muscle may be involved and the mitral valve is frequently involved.'},
{t:'Aortic and pulmonic valves',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>The tissues that cover the heart and heart valves are affected. The heart muscle may be involved and the mitral valve is frequently involved.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Heart muscle and the mitral valve</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'},
{t:'Contractility of the ventricles',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>The tissues that cover the heart and heart valves are affected. The heart muscle may be involved and the mitral valve is frequently involved.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Heart muscle and the mitral valve</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
