{t:'"He is fussy for several hours every day."',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Fatigue during feeding or activity is common to most infants with congenital cardiac problems.</i> The keyed answer is <b>"He tires out during feedings."</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'},
{t:'"He sleeps all the time."',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Fatigue during feeding or activity is common to most infants with congenital cardiac problems.</i> The keyed answer is <b>"He tires out during feedings."</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
