{t:'Biofeedback',c:true,r:'Correct. Biofeedback is a type of relaxation therapy that enables the patient to recognize tension in the muscles via responses on an electronic machine and visual electromyography responses. The process is also used by traditional health care providers for drug addiction and chronic pain control.'},
{t:'Hypnotherapy',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Biofeedback is a type of relaxation therapy that enables the patient to recognize tension in the muscles via responses on an electronic machine and visual electromyography responses. The process is also used by traditional health care providers for drug addiction and chronic pain control.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Biofeedback</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'},
{t:'Chiropractic care',c:false,r:'Not the keyed answer. What the bank says about this item: <i>Biofeedback is a type of relaxation therapy that enables the patient to recognize tension in the muscles via responses on an electronic machine and visual electromyography responses. The process is also used by traditional health care providers for drug addiction and chronic pain control.</i> The keyed answer is <b>Biofeedback</b> &mdash; say out loud why that beats this option.'}],
